Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't hunt anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你退出了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You quit? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你就那么退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly make you stop just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. There was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来又没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道 我不是突然就退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know, I didn't just drop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 她叫什么 - 艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, what was her name? - Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫瑞森教授 你的政府需要你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Morrison, your government needs you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你在哪儿找到的这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, where'd you find this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是这领域最权威的专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposed to be a top expert in his field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有一块碑 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, there's another tablet? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说还有神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}So another word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底有多少神之语啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many words of God are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一年前才成为先知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just became a prophet, like, a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这块碑有名字吗 - 「恶魔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, did this tablet have a name? - "Demons."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我读到的来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I could tell…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多是关于恶魔的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们没了石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since we lost the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文觉得我们不需要他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin figures we don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是克劳力有石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but Crowley still does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that kid thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们去找他 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's find him. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:12.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明尼苏达州 明尼阿波里斯市）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺你 跑得真快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations. You're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常做有氧运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do a lot of cardio.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第8季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在炼狱待了一年 什么妖怪都跑出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Guy goes to purgatory for a year, all hell breaks loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,明尼阿波里斯一个慢跑者的心被人掏走\N{\fnArial\fs30}A jogger in Minneapolis gets his heart ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在打比方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing literally?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我也不会感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way that interests me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没完呢 六个月前还有一篇报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, there's another article from six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.16,0:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的事情 也是在明尼阿波里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing happens, also in Minneapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这说明什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别去明尼阿波里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of Minneapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.34,0:02:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一个城市中两个人被掏心 间隔六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hearts ganked, same city, six months apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是种什么仪式 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that's got to be a ritual, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也该是个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least some sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:03:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,被附身的 爱吃心脏的疯子蝙蝠怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}a heart-sucking, possessed, satanic, crack-whore bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们动身去瞧瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I say we hang out the shingle again and ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手头有事做 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a case, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们得先找到凯文和石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin and the demon tablet need to be found,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,掏心怪物再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so heart guy takes a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了找凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we just spent a week chasing our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经瞎转悠一周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to lock Kevin down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们 我们.，.\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at us. We're …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,农贸市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farmers' market.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我休假一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I had a year off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情享受美好生活来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the time to enjoy the good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我们的职责抛在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}While avoiding doing what we actually do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你每次说这话真就那么爽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Dean, does it make you feel that much better every time you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 老弟 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, man, look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这一年做做瑜伽 弹弹琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a year off to do yoga and play the lute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你 但现在我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever, but I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗 我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.23,0:03:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得行走江湖 斩妖除魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means that we walk and kill monsters at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到凯文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在此期间我们能不管这种事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the meantime, do we ignore stuff like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说让无辜的人死去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are innocent people supposed to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就买你的农产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that you can shop for produce?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案子怪就怪在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what's odd about this thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:04:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,死者身上并没有砍伤或刀伤 没有切口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy wasn't chopped or cut into, no incision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的心脏像颗桃核一样被揪了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his heart was ripped out of him like a peach pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭抢劫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he robbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,手机 手表和钱都还留在身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone, watch, money all still on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.15,0:04:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何敌人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是来镇里开会的 在当地没有熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in town for a conference. No local connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在六个月前发现一起相同案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys had another one of these about six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 调查毫无结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and we hit a brick wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是查不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had nothing to go on, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来还以为有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought maybe we got lucky here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,公园摄像头拍到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A park surveillance camera picked up something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那胖子是最后一个见到活着的死者的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That chubby guy the last person to see the vic alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.09,0:04:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再就是凶手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫保罗·海耶斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Paul Hayes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫他来问过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pulled him in for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么排除了他的嫌疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what makes you think he's clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止没法证实与他有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so far, no reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他承认曾见过死者一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he said he briefly saw the victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.13,0:04:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过了他 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ran out ahead, that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他没有跪下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you mean he didn't fall to his knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白自己把那家伙掏心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and confess to gutting the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我们对他做了详细的背景调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean we did a thorough check on the guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,连张违章停车的罚单都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not so much as a parking ticket came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自己看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他是挺能跑 可他又不是雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, sure, he can run a little bit, but Thor he ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他能抓住健壮的弗雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's gonna grab Freddy Fitness here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放倒 然后把心挖出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throw him down and rip out his heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我没有把他拉出去枪毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me if I didn't take him out back and shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh so…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪儿找这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}…any idea where we can find this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正努力坚持我的营养和锻炼计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of try to stick to a nutrition and workout schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 你超过了一名慢跑者 他随后被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Paul, you passed a runner who was later killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他说过话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you speak with him at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟警察说过这事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I went over this with the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没跟他说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had never spoken to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超过了他 之后再没见过他 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran past him. I never saw him again. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.29,0:05:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,屎一样难喝 可是能让你年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tastes like crap, but it keeps you young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 纤维太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, uh … uh… too much fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗 我们注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Paul, we couldn't help but notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你超越的慢跑者比你年轻很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the jogger you outraced was a good deal younger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 而且更…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and less, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,更苗条 你该看看从前的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, full-figured? You should've seen me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,终日伏案 整晚看电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, hugging a desk all day and watching TV all night,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃各种油炸食品 真是要命\N{\fnArial\fs30}eating fried everything was killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.72,0:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前我的健康出了大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a health scare about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 它改变了我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it changed my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I started taking care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的身体成了神殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your body's a temple, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.76,0:06:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天供奉礼拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I worship every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so…what's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.35,0:06:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在保罗家有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you find poking around at Paul's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.19,0:06:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是平常东西 避孕套 发胶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, just the usual … condoms, hair gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.99,0:06:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没巫毒袋 没撒旦崇拜标志 没什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hex bags, nothing satanic, nothing spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 他不像是个开膛手喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he didn't seem like a guy who would be voted most likely to disembowel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,开膛手不是看出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.66,0:06:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 还有一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 谋杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,自助式心脏搭桥术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a do-it-yourself heart bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件案子的两天后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days after this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,明尼阿波利斯什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of Minneapolis?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱荷华州 艾姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Iowa part. Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗当时正在这边接受质询\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Paul was here being questioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way that could have been him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙之前是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy was a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟六个月前发生的事一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is exactly what happened six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.14,0:07:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,明尼阿波利斯 然后是艾姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minneapolis, then Ames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你当时没留意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you missed that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟·斯温森 高级警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur Swenson. Real top-shelf officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,从警二十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 years on the force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他订了一张披萨 被害人去送货\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd ordered a pizza, which the vic delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被害人的下一份订单没有送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vic didn't make his next drop-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在斯温森家门前的走道上发现了他的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}His body was found on the walk in front of swenson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he wasn't wearing a heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没有心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯温森呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, what about Swenson?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜷缩在前门台阶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crumpled on the front stoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.55,0:07:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身都是血 泣不成声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Covered in blood, crying like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,讽刺的是 他之前一周都在法庭上作证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ironically, he had been in court all week, testifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明尼阿波利斯的凶案就不是他做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that couldn't have been him in Minneapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate when this happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:08:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个叫亚瑟的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this Arthur guy, what does …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对此怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you getting his statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, k-kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真后悔当初没好好听精神病讲座\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad I dropped out of lunatic 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 他好像是在重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it sounds like he's repeating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Arthur…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你一个人做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do this alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟 是不是有看不到的声音叫你去杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur, did some invisible voice tell you you had to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now you've pissed him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 亚特 我能叫你亚特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Art. Can I call you Art?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我要在你手臂上倒圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm gonna sprinkle your arm with holy water,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被恶魔附体 手臂会烧得冒烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's gonna steam and burn if you're possessed by a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是一蘑菇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了 没被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, not possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟 要不要告诉我你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur, you want to tell us why you did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:35.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯托雷郡警局）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更欣赏基思·理查兹的版本（滚石乐队成员）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I prefer the Keith Richards version.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听懂他说的词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you actually understand any of the words?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还未必是词呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they are words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听就是胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like babble to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买了个翻译应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought a translation app.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你买了个应用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bought an app.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 播放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡言乱语赢了 「未知语言」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And babble wins."Language unknown."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑伯拉探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Sambora.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.81,0:11:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡诗医生 他是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dr. Kashi, what are we looking at here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神崩溃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of psychotic break?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确 下手非常狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, definitely. He was very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断了视神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Severed the optic nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他决意要剜出这只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was determined to remove the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他用什么剜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he used, uh, what to cut with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来不怎么强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't look strong enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他掰下一块床沿当作刀用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he broke off part of the bed frame and used it as a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那床可真该贴上警告标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. They should put warning labels on those beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 是蓄意自残\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said … determined.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到他两只眼睛颜色不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed that he had two different-colored eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他遭遇过一次事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Apparently, he was in an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只眼球严重受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}where much of one eye was shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.27,0:11:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠眼球移植才修复了视力\N{\fnArial\fs30}His vision was saved with a transplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.81,0:11:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年之前 差不多这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year ago, almost to the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且有趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, interestingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他剜出来的正是移植的那颗眼球\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the transplanted eye he chose to cut out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 请问一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me ask you something, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有可能查到器官捐献者是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible to trace the donor of a transplanted organ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟·斯温森一年前做了眼球移植 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur Swenson had an eye transplant a year ago, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.85,0:12:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得保罗·海耶斯提到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I remembered that Paul Hayes was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.48,0:12:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前他得了一场大病\N{\fnArial\fs30}a health scare he had a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从而改变了他的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}that changed his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就调出了他在明尼阿波利斯的病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I pulled up his medical records from Minneapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说好好干 我就照做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me on board, I'm on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜除了亚瑟·斯温森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyways, you want to guess who else,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁在去年接受了移植手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}other than Arthur Swenson, had a transplant in the last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗·海耶斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul Hayes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave it away, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在有两个疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we've got two suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,在两个城市犯下了相同的罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}in two identical murders in two different cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.51,0:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且他们都在去年接受了器官移植\N{\fnArial\fs30}that both had organ transplants a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:12:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Also…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love when there's an "Also."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.79,0:13:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了一下亚瑟·斯温森念叨的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to thinking about all that stuff arthur Swenson was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你的翻译应用说它是未知语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your translation app called it "Language unknown"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为这语言已经消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it's a dead language,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是古希腊语或马恩岛语\N{\fnArial\fs30}like ancient Greek or Manx.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,马恩岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manx?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把他说话的音频发电邮\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I e-mailed an audio file of Arthur's mumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了莫里森博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Dr. Morrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫里森博士 那个人类学教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Morrison, the anthropology professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚马逊娘子军那次帮过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}who helped us out with the Amazons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's get our asses on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headed to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些案子是始于六个月前的连环事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we are in a repeat of a cycle from six months ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在明尼阿波利斯和埃姆斯的凶案之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, after the murders in Minneapolis and in Ames,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三起「袭心」事件发生在科罗拉多的博尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}the next heart attack was in Boulder, Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:41.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（后方入口）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:46.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科罗拉多州 博尔德市）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是奇克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚的表演可真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loved your performance tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,台下要花不少功夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must take, uh, must take years of training.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算是有天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我通常不干这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't normally do this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, there's just …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}just something about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 事情越来越明朗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, case is coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都走上正轨了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things are coming together, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起办事 真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me. It is all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你说话呢 - 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么 有机番茄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking about, organic tomatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not thinking about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.92,0:15:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但去年这一年我算是大彻大悟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this last year has given me a new perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我的最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where I'm at my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.07,0:15:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是像现在这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that is right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一起驾车踏上危险的旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}driving down crazy street next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.82,0:15:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你根本不需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… maybe you don't need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.71,0:15:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你的最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe you're at your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一个人披荆斩棘消灭所有怪物的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}hacking and slicing your way through all the world's crap alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不用跟别人多费口舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}not having to explain yourself to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.28,0:15:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that makes sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我还有好多其他的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as I have so many other brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟我谈心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can talk to about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.90,0:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是想抛下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying I'm bailing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 至少给彼此留点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying make room for the possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不同追求的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we want different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.55,0:16:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要时间做些重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I want my time to count for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做的不重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what we do doesn't count?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.78,0:16:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡诗医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dr. Kashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以再帮我查一个名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, could you run one more name for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗·海耶斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah … Hayes, Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐献者是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. And the donor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有科罗拉多州博尔德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did anybody from Boulder, Colorado,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受了某个器官\N{\fnArial\fs30}receive any of those organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证这事会让你觉得很刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is gonna singe your axons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉我保罗·海耶斯的肾\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says that both Paul Hayes' kidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和亚瑟·斯温森的眼睛都来自同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Arthur Swenson's new eye came from …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready for this? …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克·霍姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不会是那个布里克·霍姆斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mean the Brick Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个全明星四分卫吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The all-pro quarterback? - Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙在橄榄球界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the guy played at the top of his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.41,0:17:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,称霸快上千年了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for like a million years, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 但去年他出车祸了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he … he bought it in a car crash last year. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲下了一座桥什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nose-dived off a bridge or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定签署了捐赠协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've signed a donor card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生告诉你他捐了多少器官吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the doctor say how many organs he donated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括那两个嫌犯 共八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including our two suspects? Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这么多 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eight? - Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个就在博尔德 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, and one of them's in Boulder, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是你说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would be wrong. That's the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是布里克就住在博尔德郊区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is, Brick lived just outside of Boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Brick's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.57,0:17:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 可是他是唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he's all we got,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得去博尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we are going to Boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对您儿子的事我们深表遗憾 霍姆斯女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}how sorry we are for your loss, Mrs. Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克·霍姆斯可是我高中的偶像\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Brick Holmes was my idol back in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太了不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing career.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,18年的职业生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 pro seasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.80,0:18:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,7次分区冠军 4次夺得超级碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}7 division championships, 4 super bowls …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每时每刻都处在巅峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}never slowed down a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克就是为比赛和运动而生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick lived for competition and athletic perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他的粉丝不会想到 他也只是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it occurred to his fans that he was human,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:19:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您知道他是个器官捐赠者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know your son was an organ donor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟联调局有什么关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make this a matter for the FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we explained earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其实是为调查另一件事而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're mostly here to dot some I's on a different matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年前曾经有一次公众倡议活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a public-awareness thing a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少明星运动员都签了字\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of star athletes signed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克当时肯定没多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Brick didn't think twice about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他从没想过自己会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}since he never thought he was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不少运动员都是这种心态吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of jocks are like that, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我禁不住要想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I-I can't help wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚桥上到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what happened that night on that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,车流不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was light traffic,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是醉驾 也没有刹车痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}no alcohol involved, no skid marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一流的运动员 身手敏捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big-time athlete, reflexes like a cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么就冲下了大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}how is it that he just drives off the side of a bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.85,0:19:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些意想不到的事情发生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When things happen that aren't supposed to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,才被称为意外吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're called accidents, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.79,0:19:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说 大家都熟知布里克的职业生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, everybody knows about Brick's football career, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的私生活却无人知晓\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one knows much about his personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他结过婚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he ever married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心里只有橄榄球 为此他付出了全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to the game. He gave it everything he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的生活可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a difficult life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克死前您留意到有什么变化吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice any changes in Brick before he died …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生活中出现了什么新的人或事物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, anyone, anything new in his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有新的喜好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no new interests?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞蝇钓鱼 集邮 超自然什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly fishing, stamp collecting, the occult?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,超自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The occult?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,举个例子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a "For instance."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.56,0:20:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was just as it had been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我恐怕得告辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I'm afraid my time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学要以布里克的名字命名一幢新体育馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The university is naming a new athletic building after Brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 最后一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Just one more question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题总是问不完的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always one more question in life, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我的经验是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I find.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不愿多说 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she didn't want to say much, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a bitch. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 又出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is. It happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我博尔德又有人被掏心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, don't tell me someone had their heart ripped out here in Boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 那我就不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then I won't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么 兰达\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, Randa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我喜欢待在家附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I like to stay close to the mother ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见门前有辆车 就从后门进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a car out front, so I came in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.67,0:21:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.94,0:21:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许世人仍然沉迷于布里克的死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose Brick's death continues to fascinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,丑话说在前头\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话还很谨慎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still being very careful about what you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了 兰达 但不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old, Randa, not an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想保护布里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to protect Brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克的心脏在这里跳动着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick's heart beats inside here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克给了我新生命 我能感觉到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick gave me new life. I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才搬来博尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's why I moved to Boulder…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会像布里克一样照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll watch out for you like Brick did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你的关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唇齿相依 而布里克需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need each other, and Brick needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保住我们的小秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep our little secret safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三个人就会相安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the three of us will be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 莫瑞森教授 帮大忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Professor Morrison, that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.37,0:22:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局向您致敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI thanks you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我一定会想办法请您当技术顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am totally looking into adding you as a technical advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.21,0:22:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有医保\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i-it comes with a medical plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.31,0:22:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He come through?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么回事 疯子亚瑟·斯温森\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, here's what crazy Arthur Swenson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,喋喋不休说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}was babbling over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 的确是消失的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, first, it is a dead language …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,古玛雅语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient Mayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是消失得无迹可寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't get much deader than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟说的是「圣主卡卡奥已降生」\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what Arthur was saying was "The divine God Cacao is born."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.15,0:22:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡卡奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cacao?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 卡卡奥 玛雅的玉米之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cacao. Yeah, the Mayan God of maize …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.01,0:22:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米 玉米棒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corn, the big crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡卡奥是最强大的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Cacao was the most powerful God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为玉米对玛雅人来说是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because maize was the most important thing to the Mayas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然除此之外还有迫害与杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that and torturing and killing everyone in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is what we're looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个有几千年文明的玉米之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a thousand-year-old culture's God of corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.59,0:22:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们最好尽快除掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever it is, we better cap it quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然下一个就轮到凤凰城有人被掏心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or somebody in Phoenix is next up to get their heart yanked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,凤凰城也有人接受了布里克的捐赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone in Phoenix got a piece of Brick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.56,0:23:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我查到了名字 刚发邮件给警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got a name. Just e-mailed the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.72,0:23:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有答复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just heard back from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人已失踪多日\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't seen the guy in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,又收到了一封邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, oh, got another e-mail here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所大学发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a university.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,答复有关录取的一些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answering questions about admissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.38,0:23:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想了解情况 看看我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just something I'm looking into. An option.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.94,0:23:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真打算退出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're seriously talking about hanging it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.97,0:23:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说要退出 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about anything, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在考虑其他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just looking at options.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办 去凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, should we just go to Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.44,0:23:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处转悠 等这家伙自己露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and chase our tails until this guy shows his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 布里克·霍姆斯是事情的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh, Brick Holmes is the way into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.37,0:23:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺·霍姆斯是死也不会开口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor Holmes was doing her damndest not to tell us a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.57,0:23:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 话题转的很巧妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice job on changing the subject, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.55,0:23:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,命名仪式十点结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, naming ceremony's over at 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.07,0:23:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get in and out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去主卧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Master bedroom. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,衣柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closets.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克的衣柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick's closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.49,0:24:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来一年没人动过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the stuff hasn't been touched in a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.04,0:24:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙 把这些东西拿去易趣网卖多好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what this stuff would go for on e-Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你要是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sammy, would it totally crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克不是天生金发会不会崩溃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know that your boy Brick wasn't a natural blond?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.99,0:24:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 有件事很诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is really weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.82,0:24:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 这是埃莉诺的衣柜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Is this Eleanor's closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.89,0:24:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他母亲的衣柜怎么会在这里 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would his mother's closet be in here? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.41,0:24:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.88,0:24:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天跟她谈话的时候她穿的就是这件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what she was wearing today when we talked to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.03,0:24:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定是布里克死后她搬进来住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she moved into Brick's room after he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.00,0:24:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.07,0:24:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那画面现在永久地刻在我眼睛上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that image is permanently etched into my retinas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.32,0:25:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才对嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.55,0:25:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道他家里会有这样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he'd have something like this in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好东西不少啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lot of hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.80,0:25:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有橄榄球奖杯我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, the football trophies I get,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.22,0:25:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这些其他的东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a lot of other stuff here …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.49,0:25:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒球 拳击 赛车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, baseball, boxing, race-car driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.25,0:25:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他尊敬所有的运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any kind of athlete … he respected them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他这里所有的旧物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look at all the old stuff he's got …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.18,0:25:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,板球棒 高尔夫球棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cricket mallet, golf clubs,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑道剑 射箭器材\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Kendo sword, archery equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.41,0:26:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.35,0:26:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.14,0:26:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest Betsy…" Blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Betsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.27,0:26:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺没有提到贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor didn't mention a Betsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封看起来很旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one looks old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.20,0:26:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪 集训第三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, "Dearest Betsy, third day of training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.51,0:26:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长跑练习有进步 在练习左刺拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Roadwork improving. Working on my left jab.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.39,0:26:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说舒格·雷那孩子会很厉害「\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say this kid Sugar Ray is gonna be tough."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.47,0:26:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒格·雷（世界拳击冠军）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sugar Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.65,0:26:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓罗宾逊的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in Robinson?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打比赛不是在四十年代吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't he box in, like, the '40s?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.82,0:26:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,签名都一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it signed the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.97,0:26:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 「爱你 我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah."Love, me."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.93,0:26:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封 「亲爱的贝琪 又上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here."Dearest Betsy, on the road again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.12,0:26:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 不在你身边的日子真难熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}"So hard to be away from you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.41,0:26:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败红袜队（MLB棒球队）就会回到你身边「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will give the Red Sox hell and get back to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest Betsy…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.04,0:26:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest Betsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.55,0:26:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,勒芒今年太不随人愿了 一直在下雨「\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le Mans will be a bitch this year with all the rain…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「费城人队（MLB棒球队）很厉害 但是我们会更厉害」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…the Phillies are tough, but we're looking to be tougher…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「让道奇队（MLB棒球队）觉得他们不该离开布鲁克林」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…them Dodgers will wish they never left Brooklyn…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.47,0:26:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「期待周五在花园最棒的高尔夫之夜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…looking for my best gal friday night at the garden…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们的澳线打得艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…our o-line hung tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.69,0:26:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那儿花了一整天「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had all day back there…"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.88,0:27:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「阿兰·普罗斯特（F1赛车手）在直线赛道上就是个怪物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…Alain Prost is a monster in the straightaway…"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.78,0:27:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「亲爱的贝琪」 - 「亲爱的贝琪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Dearest Betsy…" - "Dearest Betsy…"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.29,0:27:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爱你 我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Love, me."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.17,0:27:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 这封看起来是近期的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, this one looks recent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.50,0:27:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest Betsy…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.48,0:27:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真厌倦了这一切「\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tired of it all."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查了那些奖杯上的名字 过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled up the names on those trophies. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.69,0:27:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 布里克·霍姆斯 橄榄球运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Brick Holmes … football player.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.86,0:27:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理·卡内斯 赛车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie Karnes … race-car driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.63,0:27:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴维·萨缪尔森 棒球运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davey Samuelson … baseball player.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.25,0:27:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯利·杜兰 拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly Duran … boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四个不同的人 对吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four different guys, right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的黑眼睛 同样的颧骨 鼻子和嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same dark eyes, same cheekbones, nose, mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.52,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你是说这四个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, are you saying that these four guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.95,0:27:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来都是二十多岁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who all look to be in their mid-20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,且有七十年的跨度 可能是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go back 70 years could be the same guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.96,0:27:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,95岁高龄的布里克·霍姆斯够厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a 95-year-old, Brick Holmes could take a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.14,0:28:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 如果这些运动员都是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if all those athletes were the same guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.68,0:28:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么做到的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how'd he pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现 然后离开 然后换个新样子再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appear, then go away and come back with a new look?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.49,0:28:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡卡奥 玉米神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cacao, the, uh, the … the maize God …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.24,0:28:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是玛雅人 对吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- was Mayan, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.23,0:28:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛雅人善于战争 酷刑和征服\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Maya were all about war and torture and conquest…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.67,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.48,0:28:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这上面说 「他们对运动员有如国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "Their athletes were treated like kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.41,0:28:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛雅运动员献祭卡卡奥的方式是\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Mayan jocks made sacrifices to Cacao by …"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.13,0:28:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好准备了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.97,0:28:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死祭品 掏出他的心脏 吃掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Killing a victim, pulling out his heart, and eating it."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.99,0:28:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们深信这样的仪式会给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They believed the rituals gave them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.55,0:28:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,战胜对手的强大力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}super-charged power over their opponents.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.45,0:28:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但那也不能永葆青春啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they didn't stay young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.53,0:28:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.15,0:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许布里克也许和这个卡卡奥做了什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Brick just made some kind of deal with this Cacao?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.52,0:28:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前也见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've seen it before …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.55,0:28:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们和魔鬼或神祇做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}People making deals with demons, gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只要他持续献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe he stayed young and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.29,0:28:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就能保持年轻和强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}so long as his sacrifices kept coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得他那些古董运动器材吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember all that antique sports equipment he had?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.11,0:28:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙也许可以追溯到玛雅时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy could go back to the Mayan days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,史上最棒的四分卫之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, one of the greatest QBs to ever play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.32,0:28:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有九百多岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was over 900 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.13,0:29:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克的事说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains Brick,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那些移植了他器官的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what about the mooks carrying his spare parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许咒语对全身都起了作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the spell went along for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.15,0:29:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响了那些得到他器官的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and infected the people who got his organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.49,0:29:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得保罗·海耶斯说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember how Paul Hayes said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.63,0:29:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因为健康问题而改变了他的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had a health scare that changed his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.61,0:29:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许咒语可以迫使他继续进行那个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe the spell could compel him to keep carrying out the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.83,0:29:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像被狼人咬了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of like getting bit by a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦感染 你就得去做必须做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, once you're infected, you do what you got to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.73,0:29:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是如果结果对你有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially if you like the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.10,0:29:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 除了老亚瑟 那个敬业的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, except old Arthur, the dedicated cop,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.15,0:29:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能接受 所以疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't handle it and went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.52,0:29:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克·霍姆斯 吃心人 谁能想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick Holmes, a heart eater. Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.40,0:29:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.14,0:29:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,站得越高 摔得越狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mighty … they fall hard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.83,0:29:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他没和他妈上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least he wasn't sleeping with his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 真棒 萨姆 找到了一线希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, good, Sam. Find the silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.33,0:29:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 说真的 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, seriously. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.22,0:29:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「拳击手凯利·杜兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fighter Kelly Duran.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.01,0:29:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二轮淘汰赛时 妻子贝琪上前祝贺「\N{\fnArial\fs30}is congratulated on a second-round knockout by wife Betsy."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.92,0:30:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的贝琪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dearest Betsy."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.76,0:30:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 埃莉诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Eleanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.91,0:30:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你更希望我们喊你贝琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or would you rather us call you Betsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.91,0:30:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺 无辜的人在死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Eleanor, innocent people are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.28,0:30:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这不会停止 除非我们阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're gonna continue to die until we stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这一年发生的凶案吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know about the murders over the past year?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.66,0:30:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不知道 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I didn't. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.01,0:30:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为 布里克死了 就会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought when … when Brick died, it would be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.77,0:30:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.90,0:30:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝琪 你也不想布里克留下这样的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betsy, this is not what you want Brick's legacy to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.52,0:30:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的玛雅名字是因尤\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Mayan name was Inyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.28,0:30:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一千年前 他是个骄傲的年轻运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a proud young athlete nearly 1, 000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.85,0:30:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为运动而生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lived for sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.83,0:30:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想结束这种风光的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never wanted his days in the sun to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.40,0:31:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他找了个大祭司和玉米之神做了笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he arranged a bargain with the God Cacao through a high priest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.92,0:31:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,永驻青春\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay young forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.86,0:31:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要祭祀不停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as the sacrifices continued,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.65,0:31:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}twice a year …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次祭奠种植 一次祭奠收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once for the planting, once for harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.40,0:31:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you find out about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.63,0:31:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我开始年老色衰 布里克他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I began to age and … and Brick …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是凯利 那是我们相遇时他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, as he was when I met him …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,却毫无变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.22,0:31:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是到了那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But by that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.72,0:31:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克的内心已经变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick himself had changed…inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.91,0:31:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经不再是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't just the warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.67,0:31:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为战斗而生的战士了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose only reason for living was combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.06,0:31:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经深爱着对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were deeply, deeply in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.74,0:31:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱得如此深切 以至于\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in love, I'm ashamed to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when I found out that …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.75,0:31:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫是如何永葆青春的\N{\fnArial\fs30}how my husband stayed young and strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.94,0:31:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了漠然视之\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose to ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和布里克必须时不时隐姓埋名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Brick had to go underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.17,0:31:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好掩饰你们的秘密 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from time to time to hide your secret, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.74,0:31:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概每十年吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every 10 years or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会以新面孔 新名字再度露面\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would re-emerge with a new look, a new name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.14,0:32:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 做过他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me, I was the wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过隐姓埋名的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was the woman in hiding,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.95,0:32:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了四十岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, when I got into my 40s,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.26,0:32:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了布里克的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became Brick's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是埃莉诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.30,0:32:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.72,0:32:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想象不到这担子有多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't imagine the burden of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.76,0:32:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想布里克也受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think even Brick was through,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道我活不了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could see the end of my days were at hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.66,0:32:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他之前也曾独自生活过很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…he had lived centuries all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.09,0:32:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得他已无法承受没有我的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't think he could bear the thought of life without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才会冲下了那座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he drove off that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.06,0:32:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定认为我是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must think I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 你嫁的那个才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just that you married one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.35,0:32:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, see, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.50,0:33:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付八个杀手 而不是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there are eight killers out there that we have to deal with, not just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.02,0:33:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.23,0:33:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.98,0:33:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里克常说心是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brick used to say the heart was key.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.67,0:33:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是祭祀的重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the focus of the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.22,0:33:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 如果我们能让布里克的心停止跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you saying that if we stop Brick's beating heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.22,0:33:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就能了结整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we could stop the whole thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.99,0:33:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那个接受了他心脏的人在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where the person is who has the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.34,0:33:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的头号恶魔是个脱衣舞娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our king daddy monster is a stripper?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做应该很有把握吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty sure this is gonna work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.86,0:33:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要埃莉诺没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as long as Eleanor knows what she's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.92,0:33:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得布里克撞车的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Brick thought maybe he'd burn to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:33:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是想烧成灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he crashed that car?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 可他没有 于是我们得代劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but he didn't, which brings us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.29,0:34:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻到没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.11,0:34:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.66,0:35:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉诺让你们来的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleanor sent you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.05,0:35:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜到她可能会扛不住把我说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured she'd probably break and give me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.73,0:35:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 她会为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}This won't end well for her, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.55,0:35:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也不会有好果子吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it's gonna end well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.01,0:35:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们会让你得手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now, you don't think we're gonna let you do that, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.73,0:35:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你们要找的凤凰城的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy from Phoenix you were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.04,0:35:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个还挺能打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you guys are stronger than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.42,0:36:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,移植手术附加礼物 还有 我常健身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes with the package. Plus, I work out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.73,0:36:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定想不到我原来什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't imagine who I was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.55,0:36:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐治亚州的一个羞嗒嗒 怯生生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shy, awkward little thing from Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.55,0:36:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,患有心脏病的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.55,0:36:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我做了移植手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I had the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变成了战士公主西娜（古希腊女英雄）\N{\fnArial\fs30}I became freaking Xena: Warrior Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.51,0:36:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上学时都不敢解剖青蛙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't dissect a frog in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.61,0:36:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但向卡卡奥献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sacrificing to Cacao?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.53,0:36:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,比上床更美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.04,0:36:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 假如我动作够缓 慢慢享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if I go real slow and take my time and enjoy this,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.87,0:36:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能让你在死前看见自己跳动的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can actually show you your own beating heart before you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.86,0:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we better get going,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想告诉你事情已经彻底解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just wanted you to know that it really is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.72,0:37:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 总得解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it had to be, one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.77,0:37:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你们也许失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I half thought you might fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.82,0:37:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰达会来找我索命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Randa would come after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.49,0:37:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是哪样 我总算能得到安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I'd finally be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.97,0:38:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多保重 埃莉诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of yourself, Eleanor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.40,0:38:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,做回老本行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Back in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.76,0:38:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大获全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.40,0:38:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧 感觉不错对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it … feels good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.20,0:38:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想兰达说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinking about what Randa said about, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.01,0:38:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉像个战士的那番话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, what it feels like to be a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.17,0:38:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解 兄弟 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, man, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.65,0:38:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道你理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.65,0:38:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不理解了 也许从来就没理解过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore. Hell, maybe I never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.16,0:38:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你就非得破坏气氛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, don't ruin my buzz, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.01,0:38:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 等这事一结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen, when this is over …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.01,0:38:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等凯文和石碑的事一结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we close up shop on Kevin and the tablet …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.78,0:38:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不干了 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done. I mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.70,0:38:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你不能不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.54,0:38:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我不当猎人的那一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, the year that I took off,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.78,0:38:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有了我从没有过的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had something I've never had.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.83,0:38:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.64,0:38:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有机会尝到了那种滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I got to see what that felt like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.85,0:38:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.41,0:38:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾经得到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.26,0:39:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那只是你现在的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's just how you feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.89,0:39:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚 艾米利亚 别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia! Amelia, this isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.21,0:39:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.65,0:39:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riot?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.07,0:39:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.83,0:39:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.27,0:39:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没见过生日蛋糕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never seen a birthday cake before?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.56,0:39:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.77,0:39:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
